<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JAN-AUG 96 TRADE GAP $2 BLN-TRADE MIN.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JAN-AUG 96 TRADE GAP $2 BLN-TRADE MIN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's trade deficit was $2 billion in the January-August period, down $200 million from the same period of 1995, the Ministry of Industry and Trade said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The figure was a rough estimate and the ministry said it would provide a more precise figure later in the day.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom ++ 36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
